  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement assistance on integrated waste management in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides technical assistance to Ilala Municipality for the procurement and contracting services of pre-feasibility studies on integrated solid waste management for Dar es Salaam metropolitan region.The assignment provides expert support on procurement for successful selection and contracting of the best bidder for the development of pre-feasibility studies financed by the Netherlands ERnterprise Agency&apos;s (RVO&apos;s) Develop2Build programme.In doing so, the assignment also contributes to the further setting up of a solid waste management backbone in Dar es Salaam.This assignment also complements and enables the implementation of PSD project MAG17TZ03 Integrated Solid Waste Management in Tanzania/Dar es Salaam composed by six municipal councils: Dar es Salaam, Ilala, Kigamboni, Kinondoni, Temeke and Ubungo.</narrative>
  </description>
